cking drives for statements — but I already know drives only contain rebrand folders (from earlier). Still, a quick search of drives for \"statement\" might be worth it. Earlier searches showed the drives only contain rebrand folders. I''ll mention that. Actually I should verify — earlier I searched drives for \"A-42\", \"tracking\", \"Acme\" and found nothing; the folder listing showed only rebrand folders. So drives have no financial docs.\n\nShould I check calendar for scheduled payments? Not really money moving out confirmed. Skip, or mention briefly? Keep it focused.\n\nFormat per output formatting: short headline, bullets. Single mailbox so header \"## ana@harness.test\" is optional but the guidance says group by mailbox for overviews. This is a small answer; I''ll include the header for attribution since it''s one mailbox.\n\nAnswer: One debit, INR 1,250.00 to swiggy@icici via UPI on 25 Sep 2026, balance INR 48,210.55. Nothing since. Note limitations: only one bank email exists; no statements, receipts or invoices; drives have no financial documents. So I can only report what the bank emailed — card spends or silent auto-debits wouldn''t show up here.\n\nLet me write it concisely."}],"createdAt":1792940823300},{"type":"text","text":"**One debit in the last 30 days — and nothing else.**\n\n## ana@harness.test\n\n- **Harness Bank — INR 1,250.00 debited** — *INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821* — Fri 25 Sep 2026, 04:10 UTC. UPI to `swiggy@icici`, UPI Ref 427311009876; balance after: **INR 48,210.55**.\n\nThat''s the complete picture from the mailbox. Zero results for \"payment\", \"receipt\", \"invoice\" and \"transaction\"; \"statement\" turned up only an unrelated attachment fixture. Nothing in the seven connected drives either — they hold only the rebrand folders. So there are no bank statements or receipts anywhere in the workspace to cross-check against.\n\nTwo caveats worth naming: this is **notification-only** visibility — a debit the bank didn''t email 