orage (SFTP/FTP/WebDAV/S3).\n- **Drive 3 is the only scoped one.** Files outside its granted folders won''t appear in searches or listings, so \"not found\" there doesn''t mean \"not on the server.\"\n- Earlier searches for \"A-42\", \"tracking\" and \"Acme\" came back empty across all seven, so no order or shipping documents live in any connected drive.\n\nWant me to browse the top level of each drive so you can see which is which by content?","createdAt":1792940828373}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"**7 drives connected**, all under `ana@harness.test` — no other account in this workspace has storage attached.\n\n## ana@harness.test\n\n| # | Provider | Access | driveId |\n|---|----------|--------|---------|\n| 1 | SFTP | Full drive | `c92b4299-1f7c-571a-ab7e-aa39d6c8bb32` |\n| 2 | FTP | Full drive | `66e47377-dba1-5bfd-945e-a2e575ae1511` |\n| 3 | FTP | **Folder-scoped** — workspace sees only some folders | `7966bf69-d3ed-5a47-9bd7-9a807d9a645d` |\n| 4 | FTP | Full drive | `6b8c0a7c-3d05-5f0c-b50c-e3da0da47f2b` |\n| 5 | WebDAV | Full drive | `1a17bf00-c9d1-5cdd-81d1-ce8b6583982c` |\n| 6 | S3 | Full drive | `4258fe0c-92ff-5c5b-85dd-797a798ab5c6` |\n| 7 | S3 | Full drive | `a8caddaf-15c9-57c2-a67e-93e7cffc3beb` |\n\nThree things worth flagging:\n\n- **No Google Drive or OneDrive** is connected — everything here is server storage (SFTP/FTP/WebDAV/S3).\n- **Drive 3 is the only scoped one.** Files outside its granted folders won''t appear in searches or listings, so \"not found\" there doesn''t mean \"not on the server.\"\n- Earlier searches for \"A-42\", \"tracking\" and \"Acme\" came back empty across all seven, so no order or shipping documents live in any connected drive.\n\nWant me to browse the top level of each drive so you can see which is which by content?"}','assistant','v2','2026-10-25T15:07:08.356Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
