m 10 Sep are clogging my inbox — archiving in bulk so real mail stops getting buried.\n\nNo pending invitations and no unread mail. I''m the only workspace member, so no handoffs needed. Will report back once the calendar duplicate and inbox purge are done.\n\n---\n\nWant it tighter (2–3 lines), or a version with owner/date columns for a tracker?","createdAt":1792940829187}],"content":"Here''s a version you can paste straight in:\n\n---\n\n**Status — week of 26 Oct–1 Nov**\n\nNothing urgent blocking me, but a few things to tidy up this week:\n\n• **Calendar conflict:** My daily standup (09:00 UTC, Work calendar) is double-booked against \"Daily forever\" on the Edge-cases calendar every weekday. I''ll remove or move the duplicate before Monday.\n\n• **Bulk deadlines, 1 Nov:** 12 entries are clustered on Sunday 1 Nov 00:00–20:45 on my primary calendar. They look auto-generated rather than real deadlines — I''m confirming whether to action or purge them.\n\n• **Rebrand:** The folder is live across all seven drives and was modified minutes ago. The 8 Oct review is already past, so I''m pulling its outcome and reconciling against what''s actually in the folders now.\n\n• **Acme order A-42:** Shipped 23 Sep, still in transit. Chasing delivery this week.\n\n• **Bank reconciliation:** INR 1,250 debit on 25 Sep needs matching to an invoice before month-end.\n\n• **Inbox cleanup:** ~185 test emails from 10 Sep are clogging my inbox — archiving in bulk so real mail stops getting buried.\n\nNo pending invitations and no unread mail. I''m the only workspace member, so no handoffs needed. Will report back once the calendar duplicate and inbox purge are done.\n\n---\n\nWant it tighter (2–3 lines), or a version with owner/date columns for a tracker?","metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"}}','assistant','v2','2026-10-25T15:07:09.197Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
